## Conclusion

UC-008 successfully demonstrated the detection of archive creation activity on the Windows 11 endpoint.

The investigation started from a broad set of process creation events and progressively narrowed the results until the relevant `tar.exe` execution was identified.

The final Sysmon event provided sufficient process and command-line context in Splunk to associate the observed behavior with **MITRE ATT&CK T1560.001 – Archive via Utility**.
